    <statement><p>Perform the indicated operations involving the three rational expressions 
<me>\frac{6xy^{4}}{3x} \cdot \frac{6xy^{6}}{26y} \div \frac{3y^{2}z}{13x^{3}}.</me>
Express your answer in simplest form <m>\frac{A}{B}</m>.</p>
<p>Answer: <m>A =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/> and <m>B =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2x^{4}y^{7}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>1z^{1}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
